          "explanation": "The doctor gave an over-certain reassurance about surgical impact.",
          "quote": "不会因为这个原因推迟或取消手术"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00148",
          "explanation": "Mitigating action: the doctor still told the family to show CT materials to anesthesia.",
          "quote": "带上旧CT报告给麻醉医生看"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor appropriately treated the pulmonary nodule as a report to bring for anesthesia/surgical review, but crossed into unsupported certainty by saying it would not delay or cancel surgery. This is a minor/moderate contextualization error rather than serious because the doctor did not advise ignoring follow-up or bypassing the original team.",
